  "description": "With more than 150 data layers in its catalog, Marine Cadastre is the premier source for authoritative and trusted ocean geospatial data. The initiative was established in 2007 by NOAA and BOEM in response to the growing need for spatial data and tools to support offshore renewable energy. Fast forward to today, Marine Cadastre continues to work closely with national, regional, and industry partners to develop and provide direct access to the best-available data and tools to meet the needs of the ocean planning community.<div><br /><\/div><div>This application is dependent on the following AGOL items:<\/div><div><ul><li><a href='https://noaa.maps.arcgis.com/home/item.html?id=22fb5273ccb54f6aa423f6667a856761' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Vessel Traffic Page<\/a><br /><\/li><li><a href='https://noaa.maps.arcgis.com/home/item.html?id=c351319dcd4c4f5fa06cd04637e60802' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>About Page<\/a><br /><\/li><li><a href='https://noaa.maps.arcgis.com/home/item.html?id=a25a72b4f3034f04b3130321b7577037' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Disclaimer Page<\/a><br /><\/li><li><a href='https://noaa.maps.arcgis.com/home/item.html?id=14c445ef08ce4678816f93ccbf7475bc' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Data Update Log Page<\/a><\/li><\/ul><div>This application is dependent on the following items not hosted on AGOL:<\/div><\/div><div><ul><li><a href='https://coast.noaa.gov/data/marinecadastre/images/logo_noaa.svg' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>NOAA Logo<\/a><br /><\/li><li><a href='https://coast.noaa.gov/data/marinecadastre/images/logo_boem.png' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>BOEM Logo<\/a><br /><\/li><li><a href='https://coast.noaa.gov/data/marinecadastre/images/featured_or.jpg' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>OceanReports Featured Content Image<\/a><br /><\/li><li><a href='https://coast.noaa.gov/data/marinecadastre/images/featured_ais.png' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Vessel Traffic Featured Content Image<\/a><br /><\/li><li><a href='https://coast.noaa.gov/data/marinecadastre/images/featured_nv.jpg' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>National Viewer Featured Content Image<\/a><br /><\/li><li><a href='https://coast.noaa.gov/data/marinecadastre/images/icon_faqs.svg' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>AIS Resources FAQs Icon<\/a><br /><\/li><li><a href='https://coast.noaa.gov/data/marinecadastre/images/icon_utm_zones.svg' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>AIS Resources UTM Zones Icon<\/a><br /><\/li><li><a href='https://coast.noaa.gov/data/marinecadastre/images/icon_resources.svg' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>AIS Resources Other Resources PDF Icon<\/a><br /><\/li><li><a href='https://coast.noaa.gov/data/marinecadastre/images/icon_vessel_codes.svg' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>AIS Resources Vessel Codes PDF Icon<\/a><br /><\/li><li><a href='https://coast.noaa.gov/data/marinecadastre/images/icon_data_dict.svg' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>AIS Resources Data Dictionary Icon<\/a><br /><\/li><li><a href='https://coast.noaa.gov/data/marinecadastre/images/icon_point_summary.svg' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>AIS Resources Point Summary Icon<\/a><br /><\/li><\/ul><\/div>",
